# tests/play.script - a game by keys (make test): the title, a game started, the digger
# digging up the middle column (two emeralds), a shot fired up, then left alone until the
# nobbins have taken its three lives; game over, the initials; the title again with the
# new high score, Esc. (Time 0: the program started.)
1500 shot
2500 key enter 100
6500 key up 2500
9100 shot
9300 key f1 100
9500 shot
# the third life ends at about 54 s: game over, the initials (50 points is a high score)
30000 shot
57000 shot
57500 HZD
59000 shot
# the title with the new high score; F8 saves the game's recording (HZD50.DRF: check.sh
# plays it back); then Esc (upstream's Exit key is F10; Esc too here)
66000 shot
66500 key f8 100
68500 key esc 100
